# Enforce LF line endings for all text files in the repository.
# This prevents CRLF/LF mixed endings from appearing in diffs and
# ensures consistent behavior between Windows dev machines and
# Linux-based CI/CD and production servers (Vercel, Railway, etc.).

* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark binary files to prevent Git from mangling them
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
